WEBVTT

00:01:16.115 --> 00:01:21.815
Osanai hi ni nakushita

00:01:21.815 --> 00:01:27.695
sono itami no imi sae

00:01:27.695 --> 00:01:33.465
Uzumakumatte takushita

00:01:33.465 --> 00:01:36.665
Boku wa kitto...

00:01:38.035 --> 00:01:44.375
Ao no hate ni mita yokan wo toraete

00:01:44.375 --> 00:01:51.885
kaze ni nori hikari no sasu hou e

00:01:51.885 --> 00:01:54.755
I'll always be with you

00:01:54.755 --> 00:01:57.385
see the sky in front of you

00:01:57.385 --> 00:02:01.755
fly high in a light from the deepest blue

00:02:03.495 --> 00:02:08.935
Uzumaku hoshi no hibiki ni nosete

00:02:08.935 --> 00:02:11.605
utau yo

00:02:11.605 --> 00:02:20.275
Kono koe ga kimi ni todokimasu you ni

00:02:37.565 --> 00:02:39.965
The power of love, huh?

00:02:39.965 --> 00:02:43.865
Fascinating. Truly fascinating.

00:03:03.315 --> 00:03:05.045
Garnet!

00:03:12.895 --> 00:03:15.595
- Hurry and get out of here!
- But!

00:03:27.075 --> 00:03:29.315
How long are you going
to play games with him?!

00:03:29.315 --> 00:03:32.245
Show him your true power!

00:03:32.245 --> 00:03:33.815
B-But...

00:03:33.815 --> 00:03:35.645
Garnet!

00:03:37.785 --> 00:03:39.415
What?!

00:03:57.175 --> 00:03:59.505
Y-You're...

00:04:05.445 --> 00:04:07.215
Jin!

00:04:09.115 --> 00:04:11.055
You're not getting away!

00:04:19.365 --> 00:04:21.725
Hand over the Album!

00:04:23.295 --> 00:04:25.835
- I won't let you touch Toa!
- Jin...

00:04:25.835 --> 00:04:32.475
Hmph, how pretentious.
The power of love? It's all...

00:04:32.475 --> 00:04:35.235
...a big lie!

00:05:07.875 --> 00:05:10.285
We're going to head straight back to Earth, Jin!

00:05:10.285 --> 00:05:12.945
Wait! Gio is hurt!

00:05:18.855 --> 00:05:21.285
Find someplace where we can set down.

00:05:23.865 --> 00:05:27.365
There's a Girouard mining operation up ahead.

00:05:27.365 --> 00:05:29.595
They'll have air and water there.

00:05:29.595 --> 00:05:33.555
All right. Gio, hang in there a little longer.

00:05:36.105 --> 00:05:39.045
A-13 through A-28 has been closed off.

00:05:39.045 --> 00:05:42.575
B Block pressure has returned to normal values.

00:05:42.575 --> 00:05:46.585
The two Dragons are flying toward sector 107.

00:05:46.585 --> 00:05:49.815
I've been made to be quite the fool, huh?

00:05:52.155 --> 00:05:54.485
How long are you planning to lie there?

00:06:01.495 --> 00:06:03.895
No more playing around.

00:06:06.835 --> 00:06:09.105
Let's go, Garnet.

00:06:16.015 --> 00:06:19.345
Commencing final check on the Avenir.

00:06:19.345 --> 00:06:22.405
Scheduled time of completion is 1430 hours.

00:06:24.785 --> 00:06:27.525
Judging from your expression,
the meeting went...

00:06:27.525 --> 00:06:29.755
Abysmally! That king!

00:06:29.755 --> 00:06:32.425
Whenever anything makes him uncomfortable,

00:06:32.425 --> 00:06:35.495
he thinks he can pass it off as
Prince Asim acting on his own.

00:06:35.495 --> 00:06:39.365
I'm not going to let those upstart
mercenaries have their way forever.

00:06:39.365 --> 00:06:43.845
Well, they do control half of
the world's energy resources.

00:06:43.845 --> 00:06:45.975
You can't go at them too hard.

00:06:45.975 --> 00:06:48.175
It's galling!

00:06:49.475 --> 00:06:52.845
Reading three Dragon life pulses on Mars!

00:06:54.355 --> 00:06:58.625
Machina and Gio...
and the third one is unknown.

00:06:58.625 --> 00:07:00.695
W-What?!

00:07:00.695 --> 00:07:03.785
Is this more of the prince's fun and games?

00:07:17.405 --> 00:07:18.875
Are you okay?

00:07:18.875 --> 00:07:22.015
- Be strong, Gio!
- Jin...

00:07:22.015 --> 00:07:23.875
Let me give it a try.

00:08:34.055 --> 00:08:35.645
Gio!

00:08:38.255 --> 00:08:40.055
Jin?

00:08:43.555 --> 00:08:45.395
Thank goodness.

00:08:50.565 --> 00:08:52.665
Toa!

00:08:52.665 --> 00:08:58.405
I'm fine... just a little tired.
I'll recover after I rest for a little bit.

00:08:59.845 --> 00:09:03.745
Sorry to put you through that for my sake.

00:09:03.745 --> 00:09:08.585
Mm-mm, it's okay. You're always protecting me.

00:09:08.585 --> 00:09:12.925
So now, it's my turn to help you.

00:09:12.925 --> 00:09:17.765
For the time being, we'll rest here,
until they both recover their strength.

00:09:17.765 --> 00:09:20.935
You bet. Let's have ourselves a break here.

00:09:20.935 --> 00:09:25.265
Aw, it sure would be great if
there were a hot spring here.

00:09:25.265 --> 00:09:27.705
Akira-chan...

00:09:27.705 --> 00:09:29.335
Over there.

00:09:37.815 --> 00:09:39.615
It couldn't be...

00:09:54.235 --> 00:09:58.165
So they take Mars' underground ice
and thaw it to get water.

00:09:58.165 --> 00:10:02.135
This hot spring is a by-product of that.

00:10:02.135 --> 00:10:04.575
They could build a spa here, too.

00:10:04.575 --> 00:10:08.015
A spa, huh? The two of us
haven't been in the water like this

00:10:08.015 --> 00:10:10.045
since the Moon, huh?

00:10:10.045 --> 00:10:12.915
Toa was with us then, though.

00:10:12.915 --> 00:10:16.515
She can't very well be with us
without her bathing suit, after all.

00:10:16.515 --> 00:10:18.355
Is that how it is?

00:10:18.355 --> 00:10:20.655
Yeah, that's how it is.

00:10:20.655 --> 00:10:23.825
Man, how convenient did this turn out to be?

00:10:23.825 --> 00:10:26.925
A hot spring, here, beneath the surface of Mars.

00:10:26.925 --> 00:10:29.535
It's paradise, paradise.

00:10:29.535 --> 00:10:31.835
Akira-chan, you're showing poor manners.

00:10:31.835 --> 00:10:33.835
Okay, okay.

00:10:33.835 --> 00:10:36.775
Like I'm always telling you, only answer once.

00:10:36.775 --> 00:10:38.245
Okay, okay.

00:10:38.245 --> 00:10:40.615
- Not again!
- Oh, my bad.

00:10:40.615 --> 00:10:43.175
That goes for that language, too.

00:10:45.515 --> 00:10:48.115
I sure have come a long way, huh?

00:10:48.115 --> 00:10:54.095
It was just a short while ago
that I first went into space at all.

00:10:54.095 --> 00:10:58.795
If it wasn't for you, Gio, I would
have never come this far.

00:10:58.795 --> 00:11:02.055
I wouldn't have been able to help Toa, either.

00:11:04.705 --> 00:11:09.075
It's all thanks to you, Gio. I'm grateful.

00:11:09.075 --> 00:11:11.135
Thanks, Gio.

00:11:33.265 --> 00:11:36.995
Let's both of us look after
Toa from here on, as well.

00:11:36.995 --> 00:11:40.775
I can't leave Toa all up
to you just yet, after all.

00:11:40.775 --> 00:11:42.465
Hey, you!

00:11:49.675 --> 00:11:52.185
Are you okay, Toa?

00:11:52.185 --> 00:11:56.485
- You look strained.
- I'm fine. I'm perfectly all right.

00:11:56.485 --> 00:12:00.825
Getting into this bath has
completely taken away my fatigue.

00:12:00.825 --> 00:12:03.755
Okay.

00:12:03.755 --> 00:12:07.795
Uh, I happened to notice earlier...

00:12:07.795 --> 00:12:12.835
You know, when you were healing Gio,
your back was glowing.

00:12:12.835 --> 00:12:16.475
What was that? It looked sort of painful.

00:12:16.475 --> 00:12:19.305
T-That wasn't anything.

00:12:19.305 --> 00:12:23.675
When I use that power,
that's what happens. That's all.

00:12:23.675 --> 00:12:28.155
Those were stigmata,
the blades that mark her time.

00:12:28.155 --> 00:12:31.145
Stigmata? What's that?

00:12:32.955 --> 00:12:36.445
Toa, your death is near, isn't it?

00:12:41.235 --> 00:12:45.705
We Dragons have lives that are extremely
long when compared to humans.

00:12:45.705 --> 00:12:47.575
But we are not immortal.

00:12:47.575 --> 00:12:50.575
When our lives as individuals
are close to death,

00:12:50.575 --> 00:12:52.675
those stigmata appear on our bodies,

00:12:52.675 --> 00:12:55.515
and as death draws nearer,
their glow becomes brighter.

00:12:55.515 --> 00:12:57.315
Oh, no...

00:12:57.315 --> 00:13:00.385
Does Jin know?

00:13:00.385 --> 00:13:03.715
Please, don't tell Jin about this.

00:13:03.715 --> 00:13:06.085
Why not? As it is, you'll...

00:13:06.085 --> 00:13:10.695
It's okay. I knew this from the start.

00:13:10.695 --> 00:13:15.195
We Original Dragons used to be part of Thanatos.

00:13:15.195 --> 00:13:17.505
We're living probes.

00:13:17.505 --> 00:13:23.275
When our mission to take our kind
back is over, our deaths will come.

00:13:23.275 --> 00:13:25.865
That is our inescapable fate.

00:13:29.215 --> 00:13:34.845
When I first met Machina,
I was actually a little bit scared.

00:13:42.725 --> 00:13:44.465
Machina...

00:13:44.465 --> 00:13:47.695
Pleasure to meet you, Akira-chan.

00:13:47.695 --> 00:13:52.205
When I first met Machina, she was so pretty.

00:13:52.205 --> 00:13:57.605
She was what I aspired to be...
my ideal image of a woman.

00:13:57.605 --> 00:14:00.445
She was my exact opposite, in every way.

00:14:00.445 --> 00:14:04.315
Beautiful and sweet,
graceful and warm-hearted.

00:14:04.315 --> 00:14:09.485
Her movements and speech
are also feminine. As is...

00:14:09.485 --> 00:14:11.825
...her figure...

00:14:11.825 --> 00:14:14.795
She has everything that I don't have.

00:14:14.795 --> 00:14:18.725
That's why I was afraid of Machina.

00:14:18.725 --> 00:14:20.295
Akira-chan...

00:14:20.295 --> 00:14:24.435
But that was just at the beginning.

00:14:24.435 --> 00:14:29.935
We warmed up to each other right away,
and became like old friends.

00:14:29.935 --> 00:14:33.675
I fast grew to love Machina.

00:14:33.675 --> 00:14:38.245
Even so, somewhere in my mind,
there was another me,

00:14:38.245 --> 00:14:44.785
who told me that Machina really
isn't human, she's a Dragon.

00:14:44.785 --> 00:14:47.495
When that happened,
I always felt like it was weird

00:14:47.495 --> 00:14:51.825
for me to love a Dragon
the way I did, wasn't it?

00:14:51.825 --> 00:14:55.695
But then I met Kamishina Jin.

00:14:55.695 --> 00:14:59.035
I want to know the truth!
That's why I'm going to go see Toa.

00:14:59.035 --> 00:15:00.965
See her, and find out for sure!

00:15:02.335 --> 00:15:06.105
He yelled out that he was going to see you, Toa,

00:15:06.105 --> 00:15:08.835
like it was a matter of course.

00:15:11.015 --> 00:15:14.285
He might be able to make the change.

00:15:14.285 --> 00:15:16.185
Change?

00:15:17.525 --> 00:15:22.155
Mm-hmm. The relationship
between Dragons and humans.

00:15:22.155 --> 00:15:28.895
I figured that if I was with him,
I might be able to see something new.

00:15:28.895 --> 00:15:33.335
And then, Toa, when I saw you
and Jin earlier, I was convinced.

00:15:41.745 --> 00:15:43.735
I came to get you.

00:15:46.885 --> 00:15:48.715
Thanks.

00:15:49.915 --> 00:15:52.155
As long as there is a true mutual feeling,

00:15:52.155 --> 00:15:54.555
and your hearts trust each other,

00:15:54.555 --> 00:16:01.495
then being Dragon or human
really doesn't matter.

00:16:01.495 --> 00:16:04.865
There's something that I learned, as well.

00:16:04.865 --> 00:16:10.275
Toa, you once said that
everything was fated, right?

00:16:12.205 --> 00:16:14.775
Destiny is something that cannot be changed,

00:16:14.775 --> 00:16:17.745
but fate is something that can be.

00:16:17.745 --> 00:16:20.445
You two have proven that, haven't you?

00:16:20.445 --> 00:16:25.285
So you and Jin take that fate of
yours and blow it away, together.

00:16:25.285 --> 00:16:28.515
Akira... Machina...

00:16:30.095 --> 00:16:32.855
Oh, you're all already out?

00:16:34.935 --> 00:16:38.635
- Toa, are you feeling okay?
- Mm-hmm.

00:16:38.635 --> 00:16:40.635
Let's hurry and get out of here.

00:16:40.635 --> 00:16:43.905
Yeah. This is the Girouard's home base.

00:16:43.905 --> 00:16:46.945
There's no telling what might happen.

00:16:46.945 --> 00:16:48.715
Just a sec!

00:16:48.715 --> 00:16:54.085
This looks sort of like a
church altar, doesn't it? Huh?

00:16:58.425 --> 00:17:00.655
Now that you mention it, I guess it might.

00:17:00.655 --> 00:17:03.325
Jin, let's hold a wedding.

00:17:03.325 --> 00:17:04.925
Huh? Whose?

00:17:04.925 --> 00:17:07.835
- The two of you.
- The two of?

00:17:07.835 --> 00:17:09.665
You two.

00:17:11.135 --> 00:17:15.175
Jin and Toa. Your wedding.

00:17:15.175 --> 00:17:17.845
H-Hey, this is no time to be joking around!

00:17:17.845 --> 00:17:19.945
Yeah, we have to hurry away from here.

00:17:19.945 --> 00:17:22.945
I'm not kidding around. I'm being serious.

00:17:22.945 --> 00:17:25.615
But why now, at a time like this?

00:17:25.615 --> 00:17:29.155
Because there is a time like this. Right?

00:17:29.155 --> 00:17:30.755
Akira...

00:17:30.755 --> 00:17:34.795
- B-But...
- Don't worry about the small stuff.

00:17:34.795 --> 00:17:36.795
You're a man, right?

00:17:36.795 --> 00:17:40.825
Jin, you'd rather not have me?

00:17:40.825 --> 00:17:42.595
N-No, I would!

00:17:42.595 --> 00:17:46.135
That's not it at all! I-I mean...

00:17:46.135 --> 00:17:49.975
...sure, I'd like to marry you, Toa...
- Wedding? What's that?

00:17:49.975 --> 00:17:51.705
...but it's still a little soon, maybe...
- Wedding? What's that?

00:17:51.705 --> 00:17:54.005
...but it's still a little soon, maybe...
- lt's a magic ritual that changes fate.

00:17:54.005 --> 00:17:56.145
- I mean... you know...
- lt's a magic ritual that changes fate.

00:17:56.145 --> 00:17:58.015
Fate?

00:18:10.455 --> 00:18:14.895
All right, I'll be the witness.
Come on, you two.

00:18:53.435 --> 00:18:55.365
Jin...

00:19:00.575 --> 00:19:02.945
Akira, thanks.

00:19:02.945 --> 00:19:07.885
Cut it out! Now, come on,
you're next. Put the ring on Jin.

00:19:11.625 --> 00:19:16.925
Enough fun and games.
I wish you wouldn't mock me so.

00:19:16.925 --> 00:19:18.585
Asim!

00:19:22.865 --> 00:19:24.455
Stop!

00:19:31.705 --> 00:19:33.535
Akira!

00:19:43.555 --> 00:19:45.725
- Akira-chan!
- Akira!

00:19:45.725 --> 00:19:49.395
Akira-chan, stay with me! Akira-chan!

00:19:49.395 --> 00:19:52.055
- Akira!
- Akira!

00:20:00.805 --> 00:20:05.075
I didn't even get to see...

00:20:05.075 --> 00:20:07.905
...what will become of you two...

00:20:10.075 --> 00:20:20.525
The two of you... create a new history...
as human and Dragon...

00:20:20.525 --> 00:20:22.355
Akira-chan!

00:20:31.035 --> 00:20:32.965
Machina...

00:20:50.355 --> 00:20:53.045
Akira!!

00:20:56.625 --> 00:20:58.455
It's beginning!

00:20:59.695 --> 00:21:01.995
It's beginning!

00:21:11.975 --> 00:21:13.835
She's out of control!

00:21:28.895 --> 00:21:30.515
Machina...

00:22:19.445 --> 00:22:21.715
Hakisuteta kotoba no imi sae

00:22:21.715 --> 00:22:23.975
fukaku kangaetari wa shinai

00:22:23.975 --> 00:22:28.315
ima wo tada nigekiru dake

00:22:28.315 --> 00:22:30.585
Mata nannimo nakatta you ni

00:22:30.585 --> 00:22:32.725
onaji koto wo kurikaeshite'ru

00:22:32.725 --> 00:22:36.395
Muimi nano yo mata sonna nige

00:22:36.395 --> 00:22:45.265
Kekkyoku youchi de kodomo no manma da ne

00:22:45.265 --> 00:22:54.675
Hitori yogari kako no jibun wa mou sute na

00:22:54.675 --> 00:22:59.185
Tadashii tatakai wa
sou kimi no naka de hajimaru

00:22:59.185 --> 00:23:03.615
Kimi nara dou suru? Mou girigiri ja nai?

00:23:03.615 --> 00:23:08.695
Houkai shite shimau mae ni arubeki sugata wo

00:23:08.695 --> 00:23:15.795
omoiokoshite mite mi na yo

00:23:15.795 --> 00:23:21.925
Fight or flight

00:23:24.605 --> 00:23:29.375
Fight or flight

00:23:42.225 --> 00:23:44.965
Say, Saki-san, Ryoko-san,
what's this button for?

00:23:44.965 --> 00:23:47.025
Button? What's that doing there?

00:23:47.025 --> 00:23:50.465
- It has "don't push" written on it.
- It also has "danger" written there.

00:23:50.465 --> 00:23:53.735
If it says "don't push,"
it's telling us to push it, right?

00:23:53.735 --> 00:23:55.875
I know how you feel, but you can't push it.

00:23:55.875 --> 00:23:57.875
Aw, but I sure do want to push it!

00:23:57.875 --> 00:23:59.905
- Let me handle this!
- I'll push it!

00:23:59.905 --> 00:24:03.215
The way things are headed is bad.
I know! Both of you, the preview!

00:24:03.215 --> 00:24:04.745
Ah, right! Next time...

00:24:04.745 --> 00:24:06.415
The Girouard story finally
reaches its conclusion!

00:24:06.415 --> 00:24:08.745
Now's my chance to push it!
